//! UniFFI bindings for the Offline Protocol SDK.
//!
//! This is the complete UniFFI implementation with all features fully integrated
//! with the core protocol.

// UniFFI emits its metadata buffers as large `const` arrays, which clippy flags
// from 1.98 on. The array is generated by `include_scaffolding!` below and
// textually included into this crate, so there is no source line to annotate:
// the allow has to sit at the crate root.
